Written 2026-09-02, revised same day after properly reading
`/home/anirudh/ARFWork/Adaptive_Subspace_FZOO/` (queue_logs_1-4, queue_logs_qwen,
sweep_results.csv, README.md Sections 9/11/12 — the actual grid-search
